      "content": "Thanks, this is really helpful for my chapter. I'm starting to wonder, though, if the scientific community has actually moved past these critiques. Given how much data there is on the predictive validity of these tests for things like job performance and academic success, is it even legitimate to call them \"invalid\" anymore? Or is the critique mostly just a political movement rather than a scientific one?",
